Ki Amal Elohim, because God said, obviously to himself,

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:38.800
Bein Nahem Ha'am, because the people may change their heart, the Jewish people.

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:45.800
Be'otam min hama, if they have to see war, Bishabu Mesama, then they would prefer to go to Egypt, briefly.

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:51.800
They could go very shortly, about three days walk, maybe four, I don't know,

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:56.360
to go through the sea, through the seashore, and go straight into the Holy Land.

