00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:17.960
This is very important.

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:21.960
God changes nature.

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:25.960
To take a rod, makes it into a serpent.

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:27.960
To take a rock, makes it into a spring of water.

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:33.960
That he will not take a coward and make it into a courageous man.

00:05:33.960 --> 00:05:35.960
He will not take an ignorant and make it into a wise man.

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:37.960
He will not take a Rasha and make it into a Sadiq.

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:41.960
He will never take a Sadiq and make it into a Rasha.

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:45.060
God respects the integrity of us.

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:48.680
And therefore, if we are ready to fight,

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:51.840
and we're doing everything in our power,

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:55.200
